<header><a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="Bingdone Paper home"><span class="brand-logo-wrap"><img src="../brand-logo.png" alt="Bingdone Paper" width="400" height="240"/></span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#products">Own-brand products</a><a href="#custom">OEM & customization</a><a href="#craft">Our factory</a><a href="#nature">Our approach</a><a href="#about">About us</a></nav><button class="nav-cta" data-inquiry>Contact us <span>＋</span></button><div class="language-switch" aria-label="Language"><a href="../index.html" lang="zh-CN">中文</a><span>/</span><a href="./index.html" lang="en" aria-current="page">EN</a></div><button class="menu" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-expanded="false">☰</button></header>
<main>
<section class="hero" id="home"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="line"></span> A GENTLE TOUCH. EVERY DAY.</div><h1>Thoughtful tissue.<br/>For every<span> day.</span></h1><p>From own-brand products to custom packaging, hotels to workplaces.<br class="desktop"/>Find the right tissue solution for the way you use it.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="#products">Explore products</a><a class="text-link" href="#custom">Explore OEM services <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-note"><span>OWN BRAND</span><i></i><span>OEM / ODM</span><i></i><span>BUSINESS SUPPLY</span></div></div><div class="hero-visual"><img src="../tissue-still-life.png" alt="Concept display of a green tissue box, softly colored packs and white paper towels" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="photo-caption"><span>Care in every detail.</span><small>PRODUCT CONCEPT</small></div></div><div class="hero-bottom"><span>Connecting brands with everyday life</span><a href="#products">Discover more <span>↓</span></a></div></section>
<section class="intro-strip"><p>For your brand, <strong>and your business.</strong></p><div><span>01</span> Own-brand products</div><div><span>02</span> OEM services</div><div><span>03</span> Business supply</div></section>
<section class="forest-banner" aria-labelledby="forest-title"><img src="../forest-canopy.webp" alt="Sunlight passing through a lush green forest" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024"/><div class="forest-message"><div class="eyebrow">INSPIRED BY NATURE</div><h2 id="forest-title">Value nature.<br/>Make every sheet count.</h2><p>Bring a little of nature into everyday life.<br/>Make thoughtful use a daily habit.</p><a href="#nature" class="forest-link">Our environmental initiatives</a></div><span class="image-note">Nature concept image</span></section>
<section id="products" class="section products"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">OUR PRODUCTS</div><h2>Different needs. The same care.</h2></div><p>From home essentials to commercial supply,<br/>find a product that suits your needs.</p></div><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter by product category"><button class="active" data-filter="All products" aria-pressed="true">All products</button><button data-filter="Own-brand products" aria-pressed="false">Own-brand products</button><button data-filter="Hospitality" aria-pressed="false">Hotel & business tissue</button></div><div class="product-grid">{products.map((p,i)=><article class={`product-card ${p.tone}`} data-category={p.category}><div class="card-top"><span>{p.tag}</span><span class="number">0{i+1}</span></div><div class="product-media">{p.image ? <img src={p.image} alt={p.imageAlt} width="800" height="800" loading="lazy"/> : <img src="../tissue-still-life.png" alt="Commercial tissue concept display, not an actual product photo" loading="lazy"/>}</div><div class="product-type">{p.english}</div><h3>{p.name}</h3><p>{p.desc}</p><ul>{p.specs.map(spec=><li>{spec}</li>)}</ul><button class="product-link" data-product={p.id}>Product details <span>＋</span></button></article>)}</div><p class="fineprint">Specifications are subject to actual supply documents. Concept packaging and Chinese-language product artwork are shown.</p></section>
<section id="custom" class="custom section"><div class="custom-left"><div class="eyebrow">MADE FOR YOUR BRAND</div><h2>Your brand.<br/>Thoughtfully presented.</h2><p>Bring your packaging concept, or start with your requirements.<br/>Plan sheet specifications, brand presentation and use together.</p><button class="button primary" data-inquiry data-intent="OEM / custom packaging">Prepare a custom brief</button><div class="custom-label">OEM / ODM<span>Start with your requirements</span></div></div><div class="steps"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>Define your tissue needs</h3><p>Discuss use, sheet dimensions, ply, pull count and expected order quantity.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Discuss branding and packaging</h3><p>Share your brand identity, packaging style and carton requirements.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>Review samples and details</h3><p>Review samples, packaging information and pricing before confirming an order.</p></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h3>Agree on production and delivery</h3><p>Discuss minimum order quantities, lead times and shipping for your order.</p></div></article></div></section>
<section id="craft" class="section craft"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">CRAFTED WITH CARE</div><h2>Care goes into every pack.</h2></div><p>Thoughtful work starts with the details,<br/>and follows through to everyday use.</p></div><div class="craft-layout"><figure class="craft-photo"><a href="../factory-quality.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="View the full testing-area photograph"><img src="../factory-quality.webp" alt="A team member recording paper testing data at Bingdone" loading="lazy" width="1350" height="1800"/></a><figcaption><span>Care you can see in the details.</span><small>Bingdone · Actual testing-area photograph</small></figcaption></figure><div class="care-details"><article><span>01 / PAPER</span><h3>Start with the paper</h3><p>From base paper to finished tissue, we consider feel, sheet dimensions and ply for real-world use.</p></article><article><span>02 / PACK</span><h3>Pay attention to testing</h3><p>Careful paper testing and record keeping turn attention to quality into practical work.</p></article><article><span>03 / EVERYDAY</span><h3>Care for every setting</h3><p>Hotel rooms, offices and homes all deserve the same attention to everyday tissue needs.</p></article></div></div><div class="factory-gallery"><figure><a href="../factory-paper.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="View the full base-paper storage photograph"><img src="../factory-paper.webp" alt="Base-paper rolls stored in the factory" loading="lazy" width="1800" height="1350"/></a><figcaption><span>01 / Base-paper storage</span><small>Factory photograph · Select to view full image</small></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../factory-production.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="View the full production-equipment photograph"><img src="../factory-production.webp" alt="Tissue production equipment with paper on the conveyor" loading="lazy" width="1350" height="1800"/></a><figcaption><span>02 / Production equipment</span><small>Factory photograph · Select to view full image</small></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../factory-warehouse.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="View the full finished-goods storage photograph"><img src="../factory-warehouse.webp" alt="Bingdone cartons and finished products in the storage area" loading="lazy" width="1800" height="1350"/></a><figcaption><span>03 / Finished-goods storage</span><small>Factory photograph · Select to view full image</small></figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section id="solutions" class="section solutions"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">BUSINESS SOLUTIONS</div><h2>The right care for every space.</h2></div></div><div class="solution-grid"><article><span class="solution-index">01 / HOTEL</span><h3>Hotels & guesthouses</h3><p>Guest-room facial tissue and paper towels for shared areas. Discuss packaging that complements your space and guest experience.</p><button data-inquiry data-intent="Hotel / guesthouse supply">Prepare a hotel inquiry <span>＋</span></button></article><article><span class="solution-index">02 / BUSINESS</span><h3>Businesses & offices</h3><p>Tissue for offices, reception areas and shared washrooms. Plan purchases around headcount, use and replenishment needs.</p><button data-inquiry data-intent="Business / office supply">Prepare a business inquiry <span>＋</span></button></article><article><span class="solution-index">03 / BRAND</span><h3>Brands & distributors</h3><p>Develop private-label products and channel ranges, from tissue specifications to packaging for different sales settings.</p><button data-inquiry data-intent="OEM / custom packaging">Prepare a brand inquiry <span>＋</span></button></article></div></section>
<section id="about" class="about section"><div><div class="eyebrow">ABOUT BINGDONE</div><h2>An everyday essential.<br/>Everyday attention.</h2></div><div class="about-copy"><p>Based in Guangzhou, Bingdone serves everyday and commercial tissue needs. Our business covers own-brand products, OEM and packaging customization, and hotel and business supply, with clear product information and straightforward communication.</p><div class="values"><span>Consider everyday use</span><span>Keep specifications clear</span><span>Value brand presentation</span></div></div></section>
<section id="nature" class="nature-section"><figure class="tree-photo"><img src="../tree-light.webp" alt="A tree trunk and fresh green leaves in morning light" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024"/><figcaption>Nature concept image</figcaption></figure><div class="nature-copy"><div class="eyebrow">A LITTLE LESS WASTE</div><h2>Be kind to everyday life.<br/>And to nature.</h2><p class="nature-lead">Use tissue thoughtfully. Reduce unnecessary waste.<br/>Start with a sheet, a pack and a purchasing decision.</p><div class="nature-principles"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>Use what you need</h3><p>Take the amount your task calls for and make each sheet useful.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Keep packaging purposeful</h3><p>Consider what packaging is needed when customizing, and avoid unnecessary decoration and materials.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>Plan purchases carefully</h3><p>Replenish according to use and stock levels to avoid excess purchasing and unused inventory.</p></div></article></div><p class="nature-footnote">Using resources thoughtfully is a daily habit we hope to share.</p></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="contact section"><div class="eyebrow">LET'S TALK</div><h2>Talk to us about your tissue needs.</h2><p>Tell us the product type, expected quantity and packaging ideas. Start with a clear inquiry brief.</p><div class="contact-details"><div><span>Phone</span><a href="tel:+862036933823">+86 20 3693 3823</a></div><div><span>Email</span><a href="mailto:bingdone123@qq.com">bingdone123@qq.com</a></div><div class="contact-address"><span>Address</span><p>5/F, Building A, New Carbon Valley Industrial Park,<br/>No. 4-7 Qiyuan Avenue, Huashan Town,<br/>Huadu District, Guangzhou, China</p></div></div><div class="contact-actions"><button class="button primary" data-inquiry>Create an inquiry brief</button><a class="button secondary" href="mailto:bingdone123@qq.com?subject=Tissue%20Supply%20Inquiry">Contact by email</a></div></section>
</main><footer><a class="brand" href="#home"><span class="brand-logo-wrap"><img src="../brand-logo.png" alt="Bingdone Paper" width="400" height="240"/></span></a><p>Bingdone Paper · Guangzhou</p><div><a href="#products">Products</a><a href="#custom">OEM</a><a href="#solutions">Supply</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></div><small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Bingdone Paper</small></footer>
<dialog id="product-dialog"><button class="close" aria-label="Close product details">×</button><div class="eyebrow">PRODUCT DETAILS</div><h2 id="product-title"></h2><img id="product-detail-image" hidden alt=""/><p id="product-detail"></p><ul id="product-specs"></ul><button class="button primary" id="product-inquiry">Prepare an inquiry</button></dialog>
<dialog id="inquiry-dialog"><button class="close" aria-label="Close inquiry brief">×</button><div class="eyebrow">INQUIRY BRIEF</div><h2>Start with your requirements.</h2><p class="dialog-desc">Copy or download your brief to share with our team. This page does not send or store your information. You can email us at <a href="mailto:bingdone123@qq.com">bingdone123@qq.com</a>.</p><form id="brief-form"><label>Inquiry type<select name="intent"><option>Hotel / guesthouse supply</option><option>Business / office supply</option><option>OEM / custom packaging</option><option>Own-brand product partnership</option></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>Company / brand name<input name="company" placeholder="Enter your company or brand" maxlength="100" required/></label><label>Expected quantity<input name="quantity" placeholder="e.g. 100 cartons, or to be confirmed" maxlength="100" required/></label></div><label>Product and customization needs<textarea name="requirements" rows="3" placeholder="Product type, dimensions, ply, pull count, packaging and lead time" maxlength="1500" required></textarea></label><button class="button primary" type="submit">Create brief</button></form><div id="brief-result" hidden><pre id="brief-text"></pre><div class="actions"><button id="copy-brief" class="button primary">Copy brief</button><button id="download-brief" class="button secondary">Download brief</button><button id="edit-brief" class="text-link">Edit</button></div><p id="brief-status" role="status"></p></div></dialog>
<script define:vars={{products}}>
const $ = (s) => document.querySelector(s);
const inquiry = $('#inquiry-dialog');
function openInquiry(intent){if(intent) inquiry.querySelector('select').value=intent;$('#brief-form').hidden=false;$('#brief-result').hidden=true;inquiry.showModal();}
document.querySelectorAll('[data-inquiry]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>openInquiry(b.dataset.intent)));
document.querySelectorAll('dialog .close').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>b.closest('dialog').close()));
document.querySelectorAll('dialog').forEach(d=>d.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===d){const r=d.getBoundingClientRect();if(e.clientX<r.left||e.clientX>r.right||e.clientY<r.top||e.clientY>r.bottom)d.close();}}));
function filterProducts(category){document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach(b=>{const active=b.dataset.filter===category;b.classList.toggle('active',active);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(active));});document.querySelectorAll('[data-category]').forEach(c=>c.hidden=category!=='All products'&&c.dataset.category!==category);}
document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>filterProducts(b.dataset.filter)));
let selectedProduct='';document.querySelectorAll('[data-product]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{const p=products.find(p=>p.id===b.dataset.product);selectedProduct=p.name;$('#product-title').textContent=p.name;$('#product-detail').textContent=p.detail;const picture=$('#product-detail-image');picture.hidden=!p.image;if(p.image){picture.src=p.image;picture.alt=p.imageAlt;}$('#product-specs').replaceChildren(...p.specs.map(s=>{const li=document.createElement('li');li.textContent=s;return li;}));$('#product-dialog').showModal();}));
$('#product-inquiry').addEventListener('click',()=>{$('#product-dialog').close();openInquiry(selectedProduct==='Lotion tissue'?'Own-brand product partnership':'Hotel / guesthouse supply');inquiry.querySelector('textarea').value=selectedProduct;});
$('.menu').addEventListener('click',()=>{const open=$('header').classList.toggle('menu-open');$('.menu').setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));$('.menu').setAttribute('aria-label',open?'Close navigation':'Open navigation');});document.querySelectorAll('nav a').forEach(a=>a.addEventListener('click',()=>{$('header').classList.remove('menu-open');$('.menu').setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');}));
$('#brief-form').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();const d=new FormData(e.target);$('#brief-text').textContent=`Bingdone Paper · Inquiry brief\n\nInquiry type：${d.get('intent')}\nCompany / brand：${d.get('company')}\nExpected quantity：${d.get('quantity')}\nProduct and customization needs：\n${d.get('requirements')}\n\nMinimum order quantity, pricing, samples and lead time require separate confirmation.`;e.target.hidden=true;$('#brief-result').hidden=false;$('#brief-status').textContent='Brief created. It has not been sent.';});
$('#edit-brief').addEventListener('click',()=>{$('#brief-form').hidden=false;$('#brief-result').hidden=true;});
$('#copy-brief').addEventListener('click',async()=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText($('#brief-text').textContent);$('#brief-status').textContent='Copied. You can paste the brief into a message to our team.';}catch{$('#brief-status').textContent='Copying is unavailable in this browser. Please download your brief.';}});
$('#download-brief').addEventListener('click',()=>{const blob=new Blob([$('#brief-text').textContent],{type:'text/plain;charset=utf-8'});const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='Bingdone Paper-Inquiry-brief.txt';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);$('#brief-status').textContent='Download prepared. Your brief has not been sent.';});
if(document.modelContext?.registerTool){
const lifecycle=new AbortController();
try{Promise.resolve(document.modelContext.registerTool({name:'filter_tissue_products',title:'Filter tissue products',description:'Filter the displayed tissue products by category and return their names.',inputSchema:{type:'object',properties:{category:{type:'string',enum:['All products','Own-brand products','Hospitality']}},required:['category'],additionalProperties:false},annotations:{readOnlyHint:false,untrustedContentHint:false},execute(input){if(!input||typeof input!=='object'||Object.keys(input).length!==1||!['All products','Own-brand products','Hospitality'].includes(input.category))throw new Error('Invalid product category');filterProducts(input.category);return {category:input.category,products:products.filter(p=>input.category==='All products'||p.category===input.category).map(p=>p.name)};}},{signal:lifecycle.signal})).catch(()=>{});}catch{}window.addEventListener('pagehide',()=>lifecycle.abort(),{once:true});
}
</script>
<style is:global>
